    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>Antiquated Vehicles are relics from recent history; maybe a few of these&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicles\" title=\"Vehicles\">Vehicles</a>&nbsp;can be seen plying the space lanes, but many are either novelties or&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicles\" title=\"Vehicles\">Vehicles</a>&nbsp;that are barely holding themselves together. While not so old as to be called archaic, these Vehicles have not rolled off the assembly lines in a long while. </p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Modifications\">Modifications</span></h3><p>To create a Antiquated Vehicle, make the following changes to an existing Vehicle: </p>",
